Comment: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大半夜的有什麼事情?
Comment: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常抱歉
Comment: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,品雨大學附屬DNA圖譜解析研究所第一棟發生了火災
Comment: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原因和損害狀況呢?
Comment: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,正在調查中
Comment: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不...不好了
Comment: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,研究所發生火災...
Comment: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是DNA圖譜解析研究所的火災報告
Comment: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我已經知道了
Comment: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是另一件!
Comment: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂?
Comment: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂?
Comment: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法和十二學區的思考研究所取得聯絡
Comment: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,品雨大學的第二 第三 第五棟
Comment: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也發生火災
Comment: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是...
Comment: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,同時多處發動的恐怖攻擊
Comment: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,恐怖分子的攻擊手段是?
Comment: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有來自外部襲擊的跡象
Comment: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也沒有入侵者的目擊情報
Comment: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,似乎是器材突然爆炸...
Comment: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,查出來了
Comment: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,犯人是利用通信線路作為攻擊手段
Comment: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在立刻截斷所有來自外部的通訊
Comment: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好...好的
Comment: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被發現了啊
Comment: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種時候如果是初春的話 一定能更高明的駭進去...
Comment: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣應該也摧毀了七成
Comment: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剩下的就只能直接潛入
Comment: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,逐一擊潰
Comment: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人...
Comment: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:12.23,OPED-中,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.95,OPED-中,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不振作點不行...
Comment: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說不定在這個瞬間
Comment: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也有實驗正在進行...
Comment: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不能在計畫結束之前先倒下...
Comment: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,舍...舍監大人
Comment: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯? 怎麼了? 白井
Comment: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳明顯的很可疑喔
Comment: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦? 沒有這回事...
Comment: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我什麼都沒有做...
Comment: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,越來越可疑了
Comment: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我先告辭了~~
Comment: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人!
Comment: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳回來了啊?
Comment: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼啦?
Comment: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不能待在自己的房間嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是 不是這個意思...
Comment: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為姐姐大人昨天也一直沒有回來...
Comment: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有點雜事啊
Comment: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過真是太剛好了
Comment: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我買到了安心堂的季節限定─水饅頭!
Comment: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人之前說過想要吃吧?
Comment: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不用了
Comment: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在沒什麼食慾
Comment: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人?
Comment: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉
Comment: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還要出去一下下
Comment: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是今晚舍監又突然來查房...
Comment: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那時候就麻煩妳巧妙地瞞過她
Comment: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人!
Comment: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,其實我一眼就能看出妳隱瞞著什麼嚴重的事情...
Comment: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道就...
Comment: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能依靠黑子我嗎...?
Comment: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊~~這不是安心堂的水饅頭嗎?
Comment: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這就是季節限定的超難入手的商品吧?
Comment: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該是
Comment: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好棒啊 好棒啊~~
Comment: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也好想吃喔~~
Comment: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...這是...
Comment: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不介意的話 兩位請吃吧
Comment: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸? 可以吃嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說起來 這個水饅頭
Comment: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是昨天白井為了御坂而買回來的...
Comment: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,昨天似乎沒有吃點心的心情
Comment: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看起來很有精神的樣子
Comment: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們不用擔心
Comment: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇~~這個...
Comment: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是安心堂的水饅頭對吧?
Comment: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,季節限定的超難入手商品
Comment: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有誰聽到了我說過我想吃嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是明白做人道理啊
Comment: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井也一起吃吧
Comment: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不用了
Comment: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一起吃不是很好嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我去泡我備用珍藏的好茶
Comment: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好好吃
Comment: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真不愧是老店舖才有的味道啊...
Comment: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:53.92,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是啊
Comment: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:55.97,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知不覺就會一個接著一個吃啊
Comment: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原因不明的火災...嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最近有好幾處的研究設施都發生了原因不明的火災
Comment: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過沒有向我們這裡要求協助
Comment: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,似乎沒有重大損害
Comment: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真會擾人安寧啊 真是的
Comment: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的饅頭...
Comment: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天吃掉了對吧?
Comment: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:18.10,Default,Q,0,0,0,karaoke,我認為這是我們既有的默契啊~
Comment: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這算什麼嘛...
Comment: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我去巡邏一下
Comment: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸?
Comment: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然說沒有要求協助
Comment: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但確實是發生了原因不明的火災
Comment: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,的確如果等到真正發生什麼事就為時已晚...
Comment: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之
Comment: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今後必須加強巡邏才行
Comment: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個區域 沒有什麼特別的異常
Comment: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的嗎? 學姐
Comment: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的 是真的啦
Comment: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸~ 很可疑喔
Comment: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才不可疑咧!
Comment: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我真是缺乏緊張感呢
Comment: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話是沒辦法幫上姐姐大人的
Comment: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會不會是這個?
Comment: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇~ 實里好厲害
Comment: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,號碼是?
Comment: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我看看喔...
Comment: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們幾個
Comment: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這種地方做什麼?
Comment: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,做什麼...
Comment: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幸運卡片?
Comment: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是指這張儲蓄卡嗎?
Comment: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯!
Comment: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過這張沒中啊...
Comment: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒中?
Comment: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看
Comment: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這上面的序號
Comment: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,據說如果持有排列著相同數字的卡片
Comment: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就會變得幸運喔
Comment: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果有三個七是最幸運的喔
Comment: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,據說什麼願望都能實現喔!
Comment: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,據說找到這種卡片的人都變成了億萬富翁
Comment: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此
Comment: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:50.08,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知道是怎麼樣的人呢
Comment: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:52.12,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種事情在故事中經常出現啊
Comment: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:53.52,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊~有耶有耶
Comment: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.14,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有在書上看過!
Comment: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是之前發生的儲蓄卡事件衍伸出來的都市傳說啊
Comment: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸~~為什麼?
Comment: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又沒什麼關係...
Comment: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不可以喔
Comment: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這附近很混亂
Comment: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們趕快回宿舍吧
Comment: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼這樣...
Comment: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後這張卡片
Comment: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,作為失物 由身為風紀委員的我負責保管
Comment: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:13.16,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1000,980)}Judgment
Comment: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸~~~
Comment: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊~~~這算什麼啊 真是的
Comment: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊~真是累死人了
Comment: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 實里?
Comment: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉 久等了
Comment: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在做什麼?
Comment: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有
Comment: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒什麼
Comment: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然有這種事情啊?
Comment: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幸運卡片什麼的
Comment: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是可愛的都市傳說啊
Comment: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該說是很小孩子氣吧
Comment: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所謂的小孩子氣
Comment: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,指的就是穿著這種內褲的初春吧
Comment: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是可愛的都市傳說
Comment: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果被它迷惑
Comment: 0,0:09:57.53,0:10:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可能會被捲入意想不到的事件或是事故喔
Comment: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有原因不明的火災這個事件
Comment: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,必須更注意
Comment: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幸運卡片啊...
Comment: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果得到這種卡片
Comment: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的話...
Comment: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想要實現的願望太多了
Comment: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒辦法決定要用來實現哪一個啊!
Comment: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天真是的..
Comment: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井的話會怎麼做?
Comment: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸?
Comment: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳指什麼?
Comment: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果擁有能實現願望的卡片
Comment: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳會怎麼做呢?
Comment: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的話...
Comment: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是愚蠢 這種非科學的事情
Comment: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡可是天下聞名的的學園都市喔
Comment: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,關於昨晚新受到襲擊的設施...
Comment: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,調查的結果
Comment: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,似乎是有人直接入侵進行破壞活動
Comment: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,職員方面沒有出現死傷者
Comment: 0,0:10:56.21,0:10:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,器材和數據等幾乎全被破壞了
Comment: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,各個設施
Comment: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都有從外部將鎖解除的痕跡
Comment: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,另外 紅外線等感應器皆沒有任何反應
Comment: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,監視器也沒有拍到襲擊者的身影
Comment: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有 事發當時
Comment: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有報告指出...附近風力發電的風車往平時的反方向轉動
Comment: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯?
Comment: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此
Comment: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,過去也有因過大的電磁波干擾引起這種現象的案件啊
Comment: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,犯人如果是「她」的話
Comment: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,保全系統的確派不上用場呢
Comment: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且 我們並沒有能與她抗衡的戰力
Comment: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣放任下去 實驗...
Comment: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我只說「我們之中沒有」呢
Comment: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人真是的
Comment: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種無防備的樣子...
Comment: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,簡直像在邀請我過去陪睡一樣
Comment: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 說真的
Comment: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,相隔幾天了呢?
Comment: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如此靠近的感受著姐姐大人...
Comment: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果...
Comment: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果擁有能實現願望的卡片
Comment: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳會怎麼做呢?
Comment: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種事情根本不用說
Comment: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子我...
Comment: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想成為姐姐大人的力量啊!
Comment: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:48.99,Default,title,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:51.45,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,早安 姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也要加油了!
Comment: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有呢...
Comment: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡也沒有啊...
Comment: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦?
Comment: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛確實有人...
Comment: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,...算了
Comment: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳到底在看哪...
Comment: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳是昨天的...
Comment: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還學不到教訓又來找卡片啊?
Comment: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不...不是的...
Comment: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也沒有錯...
Comment: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是這樣...
Comment: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...所以...這個...
Comment: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此
Comment: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想要把幸運卡片當作禮物送給朋友啊
Comment: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是這樣
Comment: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像剛才遇到這麼危險的狀況
Comment: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我實在無法放心啊
Comment: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為我們馬上就要分離了...
Comment: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要搬家了...
Comment: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經決定好了
Comment: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有辦法改變...
Comment: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,分離前
Comment: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無論如何都想要送一份禮物...
Comment: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們感情一直很好
Comment: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她非常的溫柔
Comment: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一直都陪在我身邊
Comment: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以我...
Comment: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請用
Comment: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,珍貴的朋友...對吧?
Comment: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等 妳到底要去哪裡啊?
Comment: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請相信我的直覺!
Comment: 0,0:14:58.33,0:14:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,近了...
Comment: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接近了喔...
Comment: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幸運卡片!
Comment: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託不要這樣啦...
Comment: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這裡!
Comment: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這不是白井嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在做什麼?
Comment: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣真的能找到嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,信者永生
Comment: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,百聞不如一見喲
Comment: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來 妳也一起!
Comment: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的...到底在做什麼
Comment: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...我有好好的巡邏喔!
Comment: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然用那種形式...
Comment: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是真意外呢
Comment: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井竟然會幫忙她找卡片
Comment: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我才沒有幫忙...
Comment: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果讓她一個人找的話 遇上什麼事故就糟糕了
Comment: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好歹這也是風紀委員工作的一部分
Comment: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.68,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(929,980)}Judgment
Comment: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井真是的
Comment: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一點都不坦率~
Comment: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,臉上明明寫著其實是為了那孩子才做的...
Comment: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳說什麼?
Comment: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有
Comment: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我什麼都沒說...
Comment: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 真的找到要怎麼辦?
Comment: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳說什麼?
Comment: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果找到了幸運卡片
Comment: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,畢竟是失物
Comment: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就這樣把它當作禮物...
Comment: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然不行呢...
Comment: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是妳們
Comment: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這種地方做什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,確實
Comment: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,作為風紀委員對這種事不能睜一隻眼閉一隻眼...
Comment: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:45.00,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(563,980)}Judgment
Comment: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,畢竟失物就是失物啊...
Comment: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然有點困難
Comment: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,確實呢...
Comment: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這樣...
Comment: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想到了一個好主意
Comment: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們過來一下
Comment: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好主意是...
Comment: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,交給我吧!
Comment: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種事情啊
Comment: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是用以前流傳下來的老方法好
Comment: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然很老套
Comment: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,老套才好啊!
Comment: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不愧是固法學姐
Comment: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請問...
Comment: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要做什麼事啊?
Comment: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,做什麼事...
Comment: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然是大家一起去找啊
Comment: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,經典幸運物
Comment: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,四葉酢漿草!
Comment: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,走了喔
Comment: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等啦~
Comment: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...請等一下
Comment: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說要找...
Comment: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道是找這裡全部?
Comment: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯喔
Comment: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,任何事情不去嘗試是不會知道的
Comment: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,首先
Comment: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就盡全力去做現在自己能做到的事情吧
Comment: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是 不是...
Comment: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這也不是啊
Comment: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然幸福這種東西很難輕易獲得啊
Comment: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 佐天
Comment: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才沒有這種事呢 對吧 白井
Comment: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知道啊 到底是怎麼樣呢
Comment: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我找到好東西了
Comment: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,找到了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,四葉酢漿草
Comment: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是
Comment: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是蝴蝶啊
Comment: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又來了一隻
Comment: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是好朋友呢
Comment: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真好啊
Comment: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果能像那蝴蝶一樣
Comment: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不用透過任何言語就能心意相通...
Comment: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井的努力
Comment: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也一定能好好傳達喲
Comment: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,傳達給御坂
Comment: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在說什麼
Comment: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我才沒有...
Comment: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不只有御坂喔
Comment: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們也是
Comment: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要自己一個人努力
Comment: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為還有我們在啊
Comment: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...妳還好嗎? 白井
Comment: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們只是...那個...這個...
Comment: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,找到了
Comment: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,四葉酢漿草!
Comment: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好厲害 真的有呢
Comment: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然有點小
Comment: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是但是 果然還是很厲害啊
Comment: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 實里~
Comment: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡...
Comment: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,找到了!
Comment: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看妳看
Comment: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這附近長了好多啊
Comment: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇 真是太好了呢
Comment: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡也有!
Comment: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好多啊!
Comment: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又要出門嗎? 姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,稍微有點雜事...
Comment: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人!
Comment: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個...
Comment: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請慢走!
Comment: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我出門了
Comment: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子
Comment: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝妳
Comment: 0,0:20:58.43,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的...
Comment: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會一直等著妳回來
Comment: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:23.34,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:22:46.76,0:22:56.06,Default,003,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又被襲擊了
Comment: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在今晚已經是第三處了
Comment: 0,0:23:23.03,0:23:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣...
Comment: 0,0:23:24.51,0:23:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剩下的...
Comment: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有...
Comment: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,兩處!
Comment: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:35.93,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能實現願望的酢漿草
Comment: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子的願望只有一個
Comment: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果能實現的話
Comment: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子會一直等著
Comment: 0,0:23:39.55,0:23:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我相信姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:48.98,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:43.97,0:23:45.97,staff,export,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:48.99,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\fs55\pos(114,644)}我想成為姊姊大人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.21,0:23:40.97,下一回,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(376.286,768.571)}道\N具
