Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.67,0:23:37.67,explaination 01,title,0,0,0,,{\pos(31,28)}{\an7\fscx0\t(0,250,2,\fscx100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscx0)}註解  {\fs40\fnＶＤ ロゴジー 太\3c&H345761&\c&HFFFFFF&\bord\shad3}道具(Item)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.67,0:23:37.67,explaination 02,content,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,93)}{\an7\fscy0\t(0,250,2,\fscy100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscy0)}統括理事會直屬暗部組織。負責鎮壓其\N他暗部的暴動。首領為麥野沈利，主要\N行動人員有4人，其餘為後勤人員。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大半夜的有什麼事情?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}品雨大學附屬DNA圖譜解析研究所第一棟發生了火災
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原因和損害狀況呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}正在調查中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不...不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}研究所發生火災...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果是DNA圖譜解析研究所的火災報告
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我已經知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是另一件!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無法和十二學區的思考研究所取得聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}品雨大學的第二 第三 第五棟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也發生火災
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}同時多處發動的恐怖攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}恐怖分子的攻擊手段是?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有來自外部襲擊的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也沒有入侵者的目擊情報
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}似乎是器材突然爆炸...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}查出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}犯人是利用通信線路作為攻擊手段
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在立刻截斷所有來自外部的通訊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好...好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被發現了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種時候如果是初春的話 一定能更高明的駭進去...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣應該也摧毀了七成
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剩下的就只能直接潛入
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}逐一擊潰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不振作點不行...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說不定在這個瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也有實驗正在進行...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不能在計畫結束之前先倒下...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}舍...舍監大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗯? 怎麼了? 白井
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳明顯的很可疑喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}咦? 沒有這回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我什麼都沒有做...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}越來越可疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我先告辭了~~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳回來了啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不能待在自己的房間嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是 不是這個意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為姐姐大人昨天也一直沒有回來...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有點雜事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過真是太剛好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我買到了安心堂的季節限定─水饅頭!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人之前說過想要吃吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在沒什麼食慾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還要出去一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要是今晚舍監又突然來查房...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那時候就麻煩妳巧妙地瞞過她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}其實我一眼就能看出妳隱瞞著什麼嚴重的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道就...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能依靠黑子我嗎...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊~~這不是安心堂的水饅頭嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這就是季節限定的超難入手的商品吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好棒啊 好棒啊~~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也好想吃喔~~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不介意的話 兩位請吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸? 可以吃嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說起來 這個水饅頭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是昨天白井為了御坂而買回來的...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}昨天似乎沒有吃點心的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看起來很有精神的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇~~這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是安心堂的水饅頭對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}季節限定的超難入手商品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有誰聽到了我說過我想吃嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是明白做人道理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井也一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一起吃不是很好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我去泡我備用珍藏的好茶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真不愧是老店舖才有的味道啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:53.92,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:55.97,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不知不覺就會一個接著一個吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原因不明的火災...嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最近有好幾處的研究設施都發生了原因不明的火災
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過沒有向我們這裡要求協助
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}似乎沒有重大損害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真會擾人安寧啊 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的饅頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天吃掉了對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:18.10,Default,Q,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我認為這是我們既有的默契啊~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這算什麼嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我去巡邏一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然說沒有要求協助
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但確實是發生了原因不明的火災
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}的確如果等到真正發生什麼事就為時已晚...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總之
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今後必須加強巡邏才行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個區域 沒有什麼特別的異常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的嗎? 學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的 是真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸~ 很可疑喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才不可疑咧!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我真是缺乏緊張感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的話是沒辦法幫上姐姐大人的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會不會是這個?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇~ 實里好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}號碼是?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我看看喔...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這種地方做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}做什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幸運卡片?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是指這張儲蓄卡嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過這張沒中啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒中?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這上面的序號
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}據說如果持有排列著相同數字的卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就會變得幸運喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果有三個七是最幸運的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}據說什麼願望都能實現喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}據說找到這種卡片的人都變成了億萬富翁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:50.08,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不知道是怎麼樣的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:52.12,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種事情在故事中經常出現啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:53.52,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊~有耶有耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.14,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有在書上看過!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是之前發生的儲蓄卡事件衍伸出來的都市傳說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸~~為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又沒什麼關係...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不可以喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這附近很混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們趕快回宿舍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}然後這張卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}作為失物 由身為風紀委員的我負責保管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:13.16,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1000,980)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊~~~這算什麼啊 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊~真是累死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 實里?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉 久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然有這種事情啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幸運卡片什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是可愛的都市傳說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該說是很小孩子氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所謂的小孩子氣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}指的就是穿著這種內褲的初春吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是可愛的都市傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果被它迷惑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:10:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可能會被捲入意想不到的事件或是事故喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有原因不明的火災這個事件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}必須更注意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幸運卡片啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果得到這種卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想要實現的願望太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒辦法決定要用來實現哪一個啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天真是的..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井的話會怎麼做?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳指什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果擁有能實現願望的卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳會怎麼做呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是愚蠢 這種非科學的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡可是天下聞名的的學園都市喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}關於昨晚新受到襲擊的設施...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}調查的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}似乎是有人直接入侵進行破壞活動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}職員方面沒有出現死傷者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.21,0:10:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}器材和數據等幾乎全被破壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}各個設施
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都有從外部將鎖解除的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}另外 紅外線等感應器皆沒有任何反應
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}監視器也沒有拍到襲擊者的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有 事發當時
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有報告指出...附近風力發電的風車往平時的反方向轉動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}過去也有因過大的電磁波干擾引起這種現象的案件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}犯人如果是「她」的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}保全系統的確派不上用場呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且 我們並沒有能與她抗衡的戰力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣放任下去 實驗...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我只說「我們之中沒有」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種無防備的樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}簡直像在邀請我過去陪睡一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是 說真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}相隔幾天了呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如此靠近的感受著姐姐大人...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果擁有能實現願望的卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳會怎麼做呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種事情根本不用說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想成為姐姐大人的力量啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早安 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也要加油了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡也沒有啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛確實有人...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}...算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳到底在看哪...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是昨天的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還學不到教訓又來找卡片啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不...不是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也沒有錯...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...所以...這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想要把幸運卡片當作禮物送給朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}像剛才遇到這麼危險的狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我實在無法放心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為我們馬上就要分離了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我要搬家了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經決定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有辦法改變...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}分離前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無論如何都想要送一份禮物...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們感情一直很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她非常的溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一直都陪在我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}珍貴的朋友...對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等 妳到底要去哪裡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請相信我的直覺!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:14:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}近了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}接近了喔...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幸運卡片!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託不要這樣啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這裡!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這不是白井嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣真的能找到嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}信者永生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}百聞不如一見喲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來 妳也一起!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的...到底在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...我有好好的巡邏喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然用那種形式...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是真意外呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井竟然會幫忙她找卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我才沒有幫忙...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果讓她一個人找的話 遇上什麼事故就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好歹這也是風紀委員工作的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.68,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(929,980)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一點都不坦率~
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}臉上明明寫著其實是為了那孩子才做的...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我什麼都沒說...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是 真的找到要怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果找到了幸運卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}畢竟是失物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就這樣把它當作禮物...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然不行呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是妳們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這種地方做什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}確實
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}作為風紀委員對這種事不能睜一隻眼閉一隻眼...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:45.00,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(563,980)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}畢竟失物就是失物啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然有點困難
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}確實呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想到了一個好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們過來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好主意是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}交給我吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是用以前流傳下來的老方法好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然很老套
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}老套才好啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不愧是固法學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請問...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要做什麼事啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}做什麼事...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當然是大家一起去找啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}經典幸運物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}四葉酢漿草!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}走了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等啦~
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...請等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說要找...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道是找這裡全部?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}任何事情不去嘗試是不會知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}首先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就盡全力去做現在自己能做到的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是 不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這也不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然幸福這種東西很難輕易獲得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才沒有這種事呢 對吧 白井
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不知道啊 到底是怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我找到好東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}找到了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}四葉酢漿草
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是蝴蝶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又來了一隻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是好朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果能像那蝴蝶一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不用透過任何言語就能心意相通...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也一定能好好傳達喲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}傳達給御坂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我才沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不只有御坂喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要自己一個人努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為還有我們在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳...妳還好嗎? 白井
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們只是...那個...這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}四葉酢漿草!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好厲害 真的有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然有點小
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是但是 果然還是很厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 實里~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}找到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這附近長了好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇 真是太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡也有!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好多啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又要出門嗎? 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}稍微有點雜事...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請慢走!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會一直等著妳回來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又被襲擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在今晚已經是第三處了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.03,0:23:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.51,0:23:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剩下的...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}兩處!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能實現願望的酢漿草
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子的願望只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果能實現的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子會一直等著
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.55,0:23:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我相信姐姐大人
Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.12,0:02:27.62,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:28.12,0:02:30.96,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.62,0:03:12.33,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}sister's noise…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}I find it out…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.60,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.14,0:03:29.02,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.28,0:02:28.79,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}姐妹電氣  不斷尋找著心中的迷惘之所
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.83,0:02:35.80,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}無人能破壞這份交織重疊的感情
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.01,0:02:45.60,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}終而復始的真相遙在遠方
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.64,0:02:51.52,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}而我卻仍未察覺到你的那份痛楚
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.77,0:02:58.90,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}即使寄託於那天的夢想將我撕碎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.99,0:03:05.87,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}只需堅信最重要的希望便可
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.41,0:03:10.54,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}雖近在咫尺
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.62,0:03:13.83,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}卻難聞你聲
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.83,0:03:20.67,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}在時光荏苒中總算遇見了你
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.72,0:03:27.14,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}姐妹電氣  不斷尋找著心中迷惘之所
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.14,0:03:33.56,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}一定會保護好互相感受到的同一份笑容
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.60,0:03:37.52,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}再也沒人能將其破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.97,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:34.44,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,仰望著陌生的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:40.28,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,總和你一起漫步
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:46.37,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛看見了嶄新的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:52.54,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始追尋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:22:00.89,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在迷糊的視野中迷失的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:08.98,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,若觸碰到深信之心  一切將會完全改變
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:15.32,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,不知厭倦地細數著  而片片的雲朵卻飄向遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:20.49,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,追上前去就能找到明天的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.53,0:22:23.99,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,親眼去確認一去不返的現在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:27.16,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,你所傳達的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:33.00,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天我也會傳達給你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:38.97,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,像雲朵一般  悄悄地  悄悄地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.01,0:22:44.05,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,無論在何處  也一直  一直地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.05,0:22:46.22,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,向前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
